The VP asks: "If VoltPoint pays us back, the Denver weekend cost us nothing, right?" Give me a 30-second answer with the numbers. 

The CFO wants one number: what does the Phoenix decision cost us? Answer in one sentence. 

Keep practicing 

Remember the workflow from today: ground, prompt, review, refine. Start every prompt with your goal and context, tell Copilot what good looks like, and point it at the right source. Always check the numbers and citations before you share an answer. 

